Place the chest_xray dataset folder here.
Download from: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/paultimothymooney/chest-xray-pneumonia

Expected structure:
data/
└── chest_xray/
    ├── train/
    │   ├── NORMAL/
    │   └── PNEUMONIA/
    ├── val/
    │   ├── NORMAL/
    │   └── PNEUMONIA/
    └── test/
        ├── NORMAL/
        └── PNEUMONIA/
